    <div class="xray__lens"></div>
    <div class="hero__scrim"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <p class="hero__kicker reveal">The smart operators don't guess. They measure.</p>

      <h1 class="hero__title reveal" id="hero-title">
        We cut your hotel's energy costs and
        <span class="hero__title-accent">prove it at your own meter.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero__lede lede reveal">
        We diagnose your building and verify the savings at your own meter,
        before you commit a dollar.
      </p>

      <div class="hero__actions reveal">
        <a href="#book" class="btn">
          Get your building diagnosis
          <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="hero__note reveal">
        <span class="hero__hint" aria-hidden="true">&#9788; Move across the building to see inside. </span>
        We start from your utility bills and equipment list, then measure from
        there.
      </p>
